cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Aran in your research, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "Aran: automated schema integration for heterogeneous data"
abstract: >-
  Aran is a data integration platform for heterogeneous sources. It derives a
  schema for each source from the data, proposes joins from profiling evidence,
  aligns the schemas into a shared, versioned vocabulary, and answers queries
  over that vocabulary with Apache Calcite and DuckDB.
authors:
  - name: "DTAK research group, Universitat Politècnica de Catalunya"
    website: "https://www.upc.edu"
repository-code: "https://github.com/dtak-upc/aran"
url: "https://dtak-upc.github.io/aran/"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
keywords:
  - data integration
  - schema integration
  - data lakes
  - query processing
  - Apache Calcite
  - DuckDB
